{
  "slug": "dataink",
  "name": "Dataink",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI skills for effective data communication — visualization, storytelling, and infographic design based on Tufte, Few, and Knaflic methodologies",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `dashboard-design` (Designs dashboard layouts with KPI hierarchy, component selection, and attention choreography), `data-storyteller` (Structures the narrative arc, flow, and logic of data-driven presentations and reports), `data-visualization` (Selects, designs, and refines data visualizations for clarity, accuracy, and accessibility), `infographic-creator` (Designs the layout, color strategy, and narrative structure of data-driven infographics), `table-design` (Designs clear, readable data tables — structure, alignment, number formatting, grouping, and summary rows), `visualization-review` (Critiques and improves existing data visualizations using a prioritized rule system (P0 accessibility and integrity, P1 clarity, P2…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install dataink@claude-community` from `oh-da/dataink`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 6,
    "hook": 1
  },
